  "title": "Permian Resources Announces Corporate Reorganization to Further Strengthen Its Best-In-Class Shareholder Alignment and Advance Towards Up-C Simplification",
  "summary": "MIDLAND, Texas – Permian Resources Corporation (NYSE: PR) (“Permian Resources,” “we,” “us,” “our” or the “Company”) today announced a corporate reorganization pursuant to which Permian Resources’ management team members and other long-term holders are exchanging their Class C shares for Class A shares. This transaction better aligns management ownership with public investors, enhances the ability […]",
